    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Breastfeeding is often considered to be a 'natural' process for the mother and her newborn. This view not only implies that initiating breastfeeding is easy but it also downplays the challenges faced by new mothers, particularly those living in rural parts of Pakistan's province of Sindh.",
